It is necessaray that an EntityType has one and only one Name
It is necessary that an Attribute has one and only one Name
It is necessary that a Name is a string value
It is necessary that a Label is a string value
It is obligatory that a Name must conform to a chosen NamingConvention
It is possible that an EntityType contains one or more Attributes
It is necessary that an Attribute is part of one and only one EntityType
It is encouraged that an EntityType has at least one Label
It is encouraged that an Attribute has at least one Label
It is encouraged that a Relationship has a Name
It is necessary that a Relationship has zero or one Names.
It is necessary that a Relationship contains one and only one targetRole
It is necessary that a Relationship contains one and only one sourceRole
It is necessary that a targetRole is a Role
It is necessary that a sourceRole is a Role
It is necessary that a Role is part of a Relationship
It is necessary that a Role is a member of an EntityType
